  "description": "Powerful motor and wheels\nThe 250W brushless motor can reach up to 25km/h. The brushless motor lasts longer and starts faster. Anti-slip 26*3.0 tires help you ride over gravel, rain, and mud with ease, allowing you to face all kinds of terrain easily and providing a smooth and safe driving experience.\nDetachable battery\nThe HITWAY is equipped with a 48V 15Ah removable IP54 waterproof lithium-ion battery, which can be fully charged in 6-7 hours and has a range of 45KM-80KM with pedal assist, making your daily commute and mountain adventures smoother and more cost-effective.\nWell made\nThe BK15 3.0 ebike is made of lightweight carbon steel. They are equipped with professional Shimano 7-speed gears for more precise and responsive control. Perfect for commuting and exercising.\nReliable safety system\nThe front shock fork absorbs bumps and vibrations and the front and rear disc brakes are designed for reliable braking, providing you with all-round ride protection. The adjustable seat allows you to ride in greater comfort.",
